sequenceDiagram
    actor Buyer as 买家
    participant UI as Vue/Nginx
    participant API as SecondhandProductController
    participant Service as SecondhandProductService
    participant DB as MySQL

    Buyer->>UI: 选择本人地址并确认购买
    UI->>API: POST /api/secondhand/{id}/buy
    API->>Service: buySecondhandProduct
    Service->>DB: 校验商品、拍卖、拉黑、地址和议价
    Service->>DB: 条件更新商品 1 -> 3
    alt 抢占成功
        Service->>DB: 同一事务写订单和订单明细
        DB-->>Service: commit
        Service-->>UI: 待付款订单
    else 商品已被抢占或写入失败
        DB-->>Service: rollback
        Service-->>UI: 拒绝购买
    end
